{A.1 = 1-13}
11=1.	My fish, I have built you a home! My fish, 
17=2.	I have built you a house, I have built you a store! 
21=3.	I have built you a house bigger than a house, in fact a large sheepfold. 
25=4.	Inside there is incense, and I have covered it with cloths for you; 
29=5.	in this happy place, I …… water of joy for you; 
33=6.	a house not bothered by cords dividing the plots, …… in the gutters. 
37=7.	In the house, there is food, food of the best quality. In the house, 
41=8.	there is food, food in good condition. 
45=9.	No flies buzz around in your house where beer is poured out. 
49=10.	Your reputation …… cannot be alienated (?). The threshold and the door-bolt, 
